ode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o047c-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3b3163edc9e235a7bd49","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，以特进孙资为骠骑将军。十一月，司空孙礼薨。十二月，甲辰〖15〗，东海王霖薨。乙未〖16〗，征南将军王昶渡江〖17〗，掩攻吴，破之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o047","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3b3163edc9e235a7bd49","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，以特进孙资为骠骑将军。十一月，司空孙礼薨。十二月，甲辰〖15〗，东海王霖薨。乙未〖16〗，征南将军王昶渡江〖17〗，掩攻吴，破之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o067","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6523651a6f46c9b94356","layer":"original","quote":"高贵乡公讳髦，字彦士。文帝孙，东海定王霖子也。正始五年，封郯县高贵乡公。少好学，夙成。齐王废，公卿议迎立公。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o030c-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-08bfc42f1e31260da240","layer":"original","quote":"甲戌〖17〗，立皇子霖为河东王〖18〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：黄初三年（公元 222 ）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2c01bc8dd8508fc686e1","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o028","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-9204f4c854f659a541df","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，丙寅朔，日有食之。庚午〖2〗，行幸许昌宫。诏曰：“今之计、（考）〔孝〕〖3〗，古之贡士也。十室之邑，必有忠信。若限年然后取士〖4〗，是吕尚、周晋不显于前世也〖5〗。其令郡国所选，勿拘老幼；儒通经术，吏达文法〖6〗，到，皆试用。有司纠故不以实者〖7〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o030","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-08bfc42f1e31260da240","layer":"original","quote":"三月，乙丑〖14〗，立齐公叡，为平原王；帝弟鄢陵公彰等十一人，皆为王。初制封王之庶子为乡公〖15〗；嗣王之庶子为亭侯〖16〗；公之庶子为亭伯。甲戌〖17〗，立皇子霖为河东王〖18〗。甲午〖19〗，行幸襄邑。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-13660c67f69064544efe","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-61265e4ab9512069ed68","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，以先帝遗意，爱宠霖，异于诸国。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-7ac80371c83645ef5071","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-61265e4ab9512069ed68","layer":"original","quote":"而霖性粗暴，闺门之内，婢妾之间，多所残害。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-7ce1991c2b52380d3b11","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-08bc87032dff67a1e7b2","layer":"original","quote":"文皇帝九男：甄氏皇后生明帝；李贵人生赞哀王协；潘淑媛生北海悼王蕤；朱淑媛生东武阳怀王鉴；仇昭仪生东海定王霖；徐姬生元城哀王礼；苏姬生邯郸怀王邕；张姬生清河悼王贡；宋姬生广平哀王俨。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-a895f294886790f65258","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-97e176b520f10e08cd4d","layer":"original","quote":"东海定王霖，黄初三年，立为河东王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-b46997898ac67b19f484","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-97e176b520f10e08cd4d","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖4〗，改封馆陶县〖5〗。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-ca3e81cf7e15947499cc","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-61265e4ab9512069ed68","layer":"original","quote":"太和六年，改封奉海。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-d5fa5754b9413c437368","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-61265e4ab9512069ed68","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平（元）〔二〕年薨。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p038e-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-884d7077d19ad250ca59","layer":"pei","quote":"奏使郭太后出居别宫，及遣乐安王使北诣邺，又遣文钦令还淮南，皆谧之计。司马宣王由是特深恨之。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":371,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":558,"end":603,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p038","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-884d7077d19ad250ca59","layer":"pei","quote":"“丁谧，字彦靖。父斐，字文侯。初，斐随太祖，太祖以斐乡里，特饶爱之。斐性好货，数请求，犯法，辄得原宥。为典军校尉，总摄内外；每所陈说，多见从之。建安末，从太祖征吴。斐随行，自以家牛羸困，乃私易官牛；为人所白，被收送狱，夺官。其后太祖问斐曰：‘文侯，印绶所在？’斐亦知见戏，对曰：‘以易饼耳！’太祖笑，顾谓左右曰：‘东曹毛掾，数白此家，欲令我重治；我非不知此人不清，良有以也。我之有斐，譬如人家有盗狗而善捕鼠；盗虽有小损，而完我囊贮。’遂复斐官，听用如初。后数岁，病亡。谧少不肯交游，但博观书传。为人沉毅，颇有才略。太和中，常住邺，借人空屋，居其中。而诸王亦欲借之，不知谧已得，直开门入。谧望见王，交脚卧而不起，而呼其奴客曰：‘此何等人？促呵使去！’王怒其无礼，还具上言。明帝收谧，系邺狱；以其功臣子，原出。后帝闻其有父风，召拜度支郎中。曹爽宿与相亲，时爽为武卫将军，数为帝称其可大用。会帝崩，爽辅政，乃拔谧为散骑常侍，遂转尚书。谧为人外似疏略，而内多忌。其在台阁，数有所弹驳；台中患之，事不得行。又其意轻贵，多所忽略；虽与何晏、邓飏等同位，而皆少之，唯以势屈于爽。爽亦敬之，言无不从。故于时谤书，谓‘台中有三狗：二狗崖柴不可当，一狗凭默作疽囊。’三狗，谓何、邓、丁也；默者，爽小字也。其意言三狗皆欲啮人，而谧尤甚也。奏使郭太后出居别宫，及遣乐安王使北诣邺，又遣文钦令还淮南，皆谧之计。司马宣王由是特深恨之。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":371,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":0,"end":604,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
